    "> Voy a trabajar en un nuevo proyecto se llama nova-voice-coach para una hackaton, la idea es presentar una solucion para:> \nWelcome to the Amazon Nova AI Hackathon! > \nAmazon Nova is a portfolio of foundation models and services that deliver frontier intelligence and industry-leading price performance. This is your chance to invent with freedom and build with Nova’s capabilities, including advanced reasoning, tool use, multimodal understanding, voice AI, and UI workflow automation. > \n> \nNova 2 Lite, a fast, cost-effective reasoning model for everyday tasks. This is also the best model to use with Nova Forge.> \n> \nNova 2 Sonic, a speech-to-speech model for conversational AI.> \n> \nNova Act is a service to build and manage fleets of agents for automating production UI workflows with high reliability.> \n> \nNova multimodal embeddings: A state-of-the-art multimodal embedding model.> \n> \nJoin and build innovative Gen AI applications using Amazon Nova 2!> \n> \n > \nWhy Participate?> \nInnovate with Next-Gen AI. Explore the frontiers of generative AI and apply Nova's differentiated features to solve real-world problems.> \n> \nReal-World Impact. Develop solutions that deliver measurable value for businesses or create meaningful benefits for communities.> \n> \nCompete for Prizes. With a prize pool of $40,000 in cash and $55,000 in AWS credits, your innovative projects could earn significant rewards. > \n> \nLearn and Grow. Access dedicated resources, code examples, technical documentation, virtual workshops, and office hours to support your journey.> \n> \nShowcase Your Skills. Gain recognition for your expertise and show everyone your hard work. > \n> \n > \nGet Started> \nAmazon Nova 2 developer guide for foundation models and for Nova Act> \n> \nAmazon Nova website> \n> \nMore Resources to help you!> \n> \nRequirements> \nWhat to Build> \nBuild a generative AI application using Amazon Nova on AWS. We encourage submissions that reflect one of the follow